            <p style="font-size:13px;margin-top:8px;">Try enabling "Show All Extensions" in Settings.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="settings-tab" class="tab-content">
        <h2>Settings</h2>
        <div class="settings-group">
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="show-all-extensions"> Show All Extensions (even undetected)</label>
            <p style="font-size:12px;color:#6b6e6d;margin-left:26px;">When enabled, all extensions will be listed regardless.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="settings-group">
            <label for="iframe-count">Iframe Flood Amount</label>
            <input type="range" min="100" max="10000" value="2500" step="100" id="iframe-count">
            <span style="color:#8ab4f8;font-weight:600;" id="iframe-count-display">2500</span>
            <span style="color:#6b6e6d;font-size:13px;"> iframes</span>
            <p style="font-size:12px;color:#6b6e6d;margin-top:8px;">More iframes = more likely to freeze. Too many may crash your browser.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="settings-group">
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="developer-mode"> Developer Mode</label>
            <p style="font-size:12px;color:#6b6e6d;margin-left:26px;">For advanced users only.</p>
            <div id="dev-settings" style="display:none;margin-top:15px;">
                <button id="add-ext" style="background:#8ab4f8;color:#1e1f22;border:none;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 20px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;">+ Add Custom Extension</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="scramjet-tab" class="tab-content">
        <h2>🌐 Scramjet Proxy Browser</h2>
