        </div>
        <div class="url-bar">
            <input type="url" id="scramjet-url" placeholder="https://www.google.com" value="https://www.google.com">
            <button onclick="launchScramjet()">🚀 Go</button>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px;">
            <label style="font-size:13px;color:#c4c7c5;">Proxy Server: <input type="text" id="scramjet-server" value="http://localhost:1337" style="width:200px;background:#292a2d;border:1px solid #38393b;color:#fff;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px;"></label>
        </div>
        <div class="settings-group" style="margin-top:20px;">
            <h3 style="margin-bottom:10px;color:#fff;">🖥️ Scramjet Setup</h3>
            <div style="background:#1e1f22;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;color:#c4c7c5;">
                <p># Install and start Scramjet:</p>
                <p style="color:#8ab4f8;">git clone https://github.com/MercuryWorkshop/Scramjet-App</p>
                <p style="color:#8ab4f8;">cd Scramjet-App && pnpm install && pnpm start</p>
                <p style="margin-top:8px;"># Runs on http://localhost:1337</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="about-tab" class="tab-content">
        <h2>About ExtPrint3r</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.7;color:#c4c7c5;max-width:700px;"><b>ExtPrint3r</b> is an exploit created by <a href="https://github.com/Blobby-Boi/" style="color:#9dbae9;" target="_blank">Blobby Boi</a> that recreates the LTMEAT Print method by flooding iframes and printing the page to freeze/kill Chrome extensions.</p>
        <p style="line-height:1.7;color:#c4c7c5;max-width:700px;margin-top:15px;"><b>Scramjet</b> integration allows browsing through a WebAssembly-based proxy after extensions are neutralized.</p>
        <div style="border-top:1px solid #38393b;margin:25px 0;padding-top:20px;"></div>
        <h3>Contributors</h3>
        <div id="contributor-list" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:10px;"></div>
        <div style="margin-top:30px;padding:15px;background:#292a2d;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #f44336;">
            <p style="font-size:13px;color:#c4c7c5;">⚠️ <b>Disclaimer:</b> Educational purposes only. Use responsibly and at your own risk.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script src="extprint3r-core.js"></script>
</body>
</html>